      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Put this on your website, or send it as a PDF when a customer asks. It is short on purpose. Make a copy, replace the [SQUARE BRACKETS], delete any line that is not true for your business."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "a7f3cad382aa1bb5",
      "id": "intro.1",
      "kind": "note"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Before you use this, register yourself as the Information Officer at "
        },
        {
          "c": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "inforegulator.org.za"
            }
          ],
          "external": true,
          "href": "https://inforegulator.org.za/",
          "t": "link"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ". It is free. POPIA makes registration compulsory for all private and public bodies. There is no small-business exemption. For a one-person business, the Information Officer is you."
        }
      ],
      "hash": "ac06475297fdb054",
      "id": "intro.2",
      "kind": "callout",
      "style": "note"
    },
    {
      "hash": "58b63e273b964039",
